{"page":387,"verses":[{"verse_key":"28:14","surah":28,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا بَلَغَ أَشُدَّهُۥ وَٱسْتَوَىٰٓ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ حُكْمًا وَعِلْمًا ۚ وَكَذَٰلِكَ نَجْزِى ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When Moses reached full maturity and manhood, We gave him wisdom and knowledge: this is how We reward those who do good.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"28:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَلَغَ","en_gloss":"he reached","transliteration":"balagha","verse_key":"28:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَشُدَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"his full strength","transliteration":"ashuddahu","verse_key":"28:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱسْتَوَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"and became mature","transliteration":"wa-is'tawā","verse_key":"28:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We bestowed upon him","transliteration":"ātaynāhu","verse_key":"28:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"حُكْمًۭا","en_gloss":"wisdom","transliteration":"ḥuk'man","verse_key":"28:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَعِلْمًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"and knowledge","transliteration":"waʿil'man","verse_key":"28:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"28:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَجْزِى","en_gloss":"We reward","transliteration":"najzī","verse_key":"28:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the good-doers","transliteration":"l-muḥ'sinīna","verse_key":"28:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:14"}]},{"verse_key":"28:15","surah":28,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"وَدَخَلَ ٱلْمَدِينَةَ عَلَىٰ حِينِ غَفْلَةٍ مِّنْ أَهْلِهَا فَوَجَدَ فِيهَا رَجُلَيْنِ يَقْتَتِلَانِ هَـٰذَا مِن شِيعَتِهِۦ وَهَـٰذَا مِنْ عَدُوِّهِۦ ۖ فَٱسْتَغَـٰثَهُ ٱلَّذِى مِن شِيعَتِهِۦ عَلَى ٱلَّذِى مِنْ عَدُوِّهِۦ فَوَكَزَهُۥ مُوسَىٰ فَقَضَىٰ عَلَيْهِ ۖ قَالَ هَـٰذَا مِنْ عَمَلِ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ عَدُوٌّ مُّضِلٌّ مُّبِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He entered the city, unnoticed by its people, and found two men fighting: one from his own people, the other an enemy. The one from his own people cried out to him for help against the enemy. Moses struck him with his fist and killed him. He said, ‘This must be Satan’s work: clearly he is a misleading enemy.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَدَخَلَ","en_gloss":"And he entered","transliteration":"wadakhala","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْمَدِينَةَ","en_gloss":"the city","transliteration":"l-madīnata","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"at","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حِينِ","en_gloss":"a time","transliteration":"ḥīni","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"غَفْلَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) inattention","transliteration":"ghaflatin","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَهْلِهَا","en_gloss":"its people","transliteration":"ahlihā","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَوَجَدَ","en_gloss":"and found","transliteration":"fawajada","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَجُلَيْنِ","en_gloss":"two men","transliteration":"rajulayni","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَقْتَتِلَانِ","en_gloss":"fighting each other","transliteration":"yaqtatilāni","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":14,"ar":"شِيعَتِهِۦ","en_gloss":"his party","transliteration":"shīʿatihi","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَهَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"and this","transliteration":"wahādhā","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":17,"ar":"عَدُوِّهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"his enemy","transliteration":"ʿaduwwihi","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَٱسْتَغَـٰثَهُ","en_gloss":"And called him for help","transliteration":"fa-is'taghāthahu","verse_key":"28:15"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","