"en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:15"}]},{"verse_key":"28:16","surah":28,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ رَبِّ إِنِّى ظَلَمْتُ نَفْسِى فَٱغْفِرْ لِى فَغَفَرَ لَهُۥٓ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ ٱلْغَفُورُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He said, ‘Lord, I have wronged myself. Forgive me,’ so He forgave him; He is truly the Most Forgiving, the Most Merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"My Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ظَلَمْتُ","en_gloss":"[I] have wronged","transliteration":"ẓalamtu","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَفْسِى","en_gloss":"my soul","transliteration":"nafsī","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَٱغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"so forgive","transliteration":"fa-igh'fir","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِى","en_gloss":"[for] me","transliteration":"lī","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَغَفَرَ","en_gloss":"Then He forgave","transliteration":"faghafara","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَهُۥٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"[for] him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He (is)","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْغَفُورُ","en_gloss":"the Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"l-ghafūru","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_gloss":"the Most Merciful","transliteration":"l-raḥīmu","verse_key":"28:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:16"}]},{"verse_key":"28:17","surah":28,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ رَبِّ بِمَآ أَنْعَمْتَ عَلَىَّ فَلَنْ أَكُونَ ظَهِيرًا لِّلْمُجْرِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He said, ‘My Lord, because of the blessings You have bestowed upon me, I shall never support those who do evil